        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Claviator is a <strong>rhythm-based adventure</strong> that brings a fresh spin to music games. Guided by your charismatic musical companion, <strong>Claviator</strong>, you and your friends will journey through a variety of themed worlds, playing along to<strong> 83 songs in total, </strong>27 of which are rhythm tracks to test your timing and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/ac67040708d2b9e15dd068ceee9e5d30.avif?t=1774183953\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras_big/ac67040708d2b9e15dd068ceee9e5d30.webp?t=1774183953 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 missions</strong> take you across four unique regions: <strong>Melody Isle, Rhythmic Farm, Sandy Sounds,</strong> and <strong>Pirate Beats</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional rhythm games that keep you locked in place, <i>Claviator</i> lets you <strong>move freely through 3D environments</strong> while staying in sync with the beat. Whether you’re playing solo, teaming up in co-op, or facing off in PvP, Claviator blends rhythm mechanics with movement and multiplayer interaction for a fun and flexible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>story-driven challenges</strong>, battle it out in <strong>five distinct PvP modes</strong>, and choose between <strong>4-note or 8-note input systems</strong> to match your skill level and play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, meet <strong>8 charming Rhythm Animals</strong>: <strong>BIRB, MONK, GEK, SNEK, BOOP, CHONK, SQUB,</strong> and <strong>FINN</strong>. Time your moves across three buttons and hit Space to land the perfect note!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Gameplay with Freedom to Move</strong>: Hit notes in time while exploring fully 3D worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure in rhythm: </strong>walk, jump, and navigate the world as you complete each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Music Library</strong>: Play a variety of well-known songs and original compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Team up with friends or compete head-to-head in 5 unique PvP game types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode with Claviator</strong>: Join your guide on a lighthearted journey through musical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Input Options</strong>: Choose between 4-note or 8-note control setups for an accessible or more advanced rhythm experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI Controller Support: </strong>Play using MIDI drums and controllers for a true rhythm-game experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re aiming for a high score, progressing through story quests, or just playing casually with friends, <strong>Claviator </strong>offers a rhythm experience that’s both creative and approachable.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/f29773d2f5b206af79bb103373be47d7.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Claviator is a <strong>rhythm-based adventure</strong> that brings a fresh spin to music games. Guided by your charismatic musical companion, <strong>Claviator</strong>, you and your friends will journey through a variety of themed worlds, playing along to<strong> 83 songs in total, </strong>27 of which are rhythm tracks to test your timing and skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/ac67040708d2b9e15dd068ceee9e5d30.avif?t=1774183953\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras_big/ac67040708d2b9e15dd068ceee9e5d30.webp?t=1774183953 width=1560 height=390 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>32 missions</strong> take you across four unique regions: <strong>Melody Isle, Rhythmic Farm, Sandy Sounds,</strong> and <strong>Pirate Beats</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional rhythm games that keep you locked in place, <i>Claviator</i> lets you <strong>move freely through 3D environments</strong> while staying in sync with the beat. Whether you’re playing solo, teaming up in co-op, or facing off in PvP, Claviator blends rhythm mechanics with movement and multiplayer interaction for a fun and flexible experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/a627dbf2bb9faf03292b688b753519b0.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>story-driven challenges</strong>, battle it out in <strong>five distinct PvP modes</strong>, and choose between <strong>4-note or 8-note input systems</strong> to match your skill level and play style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, meet <strong>8 charming Rhythm Animals</strong>: <strong>BIRB, MONK, GEK, SNEK, BOOP, CHONK, SQUB,</strong> and <strong>FINN</strong>. Time your moves across three buttons and hit Space to land the perfect note!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.poster.avif?t=1774183953\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.webm?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705340/extras/825e4ea07f23556dda67a5e27248475d.mp4?t=1774183953\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rhythm Gameplay with Freedom to Move</strong>: Hit notes in time while exploring fully 3D worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventure in rhythm: </strong>walk, jump, and navigate the world as you complete each track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Music Library</strong>: Play a variety of well-known songs and original compositions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Modes</strong>: Team up with friends or compete head-to-head in 5 unique PvP game types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode with Claviator</strong>: Join your guide on a lighthearted journey through musical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Input Options</strong>: Choose between 4-note or 8-note control setups for an accessible or more advanced rhythm experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI Controller Support: </strong>Play using MIDI drums and controllers for a true rhythm-game experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re aiming for a high score, progressing through story quests, or just playing casually with friends, <strong>Claviator </strong>offers a rhythm experience that’s both creative and approachable.</p>",
